WEBVTT

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:03.850 line:95%,end
Hello, I'm Alexander Hübel, I'm the CEO of PubliX Group.

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.830 line:95%,end
We are a Stockholm-based buy-and-build platform,

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:11.810 line:95%,end
PE-backed. Buy-and-build means that we acquire SaaS companies from Northern

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:14.030 line:95%,end
Europe that are focusing on the public sector,

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:17.420 line:95%,end
and we help them take the next step in their growth journey.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:25.080 line:95%,end
They often have 15–20 employees, and they just are unable to take that next step.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.680 line:95%,end
That is where PubliX comes in.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:31.700 line:95%,end
So we help them unlock the next growth engine in their journey.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.930 line:95%,end
We were talking with several potential buyers,

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:45.640 line:95%,end
and with PubliX we got a good feeling that they will also help us in the succession.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.520 line:95%,end
Already when we were contacted, we had great trust in this buyer.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:54.300 line:95%,end
That they were serious, that they treated us with respect,

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:59.800 line:95%,end
that they asked good, reasonable questions and really listened to our answers.

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:03.520 line:95%,end
One important reason for us to join the PubliX Group:

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:09.190 line:95%,end
they help us expand in Sweden, Norway and other markets.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:13.560 line:95%,end
And given the discussions so far with the other CEOs,

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:20.420 line:95%,end
it is the opening of doors to the municipalities and regions in Sweden –

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:22.670 line:95%,end
and we really appreciate that help.

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:30.070 line:95%,end
So at PubliX we see a context with a strong focus on that market,

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:38.990 line:95%,end
where together we become stronger and can build something stable and strong for the future.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:43.650 line:95%,end
With the support and help we get from PubliX, I feel confident

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:46.570 line:95%,end
that we will reach the goals we have set.

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:51.380 line:95%,end
Now we are actively acquiring in the Northern European market.

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:56.520 line:95%,end
So we are looking for companies that are profitable,

00:01:56.520 --> 00:02:00.313 line:95%,end
that have a decent growth rate –

00:02:00.313 --> 00:02:03.080 line:95%,end
but now it's time to join something bigger.
